</span></span>
<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S3.T1.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.8.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
